## Application Notes

The Ewing 3115 motor is intended for high-reliability platforms where efficiency, thermal margin, and mechanical robustness are critical. Proper airflow and conservative ESC tuning are recommended when operating near maximum current or power limits.

For integration guidance, thrust data, or qualification support, contact Ewing Aerospace engineering.

